content:
This App is an essential app for cross-country communication. However, the Mac's Desktop version for some reason is so poorly developed that:

1.) It can't be updated (the update button itself doesn't work when I click it);

2.) As others have indiated, the emojis either don't show up properly or lag during input;

3.) The app crashes from time to time.

original_content:
This App is an essential app for cross-country communication. However, the Mac's Desktop version for some reason is so poorly developed that: 

1.) It can't be updated (the update button itself doesn't work when I click it);

2.) As others have indiated, the emojis either don't show up properly or lag during input;

3.) The app crashes from time to time.
